# CargoIQ Backend

Backend API for **CargoIQ**, an AI-powered international trade compliance platform.

CargoIQ helps businesses analyze products before international shipment by using Google's Gemini AI to identify product characteristics, estimate import duties, highlight required documentation, and provide country-specific compliance recommendations.

---

# Features

- User Authentication (JWT)
- Secure Password Hashing (bcrypt)
- PostgreSQL Database (Prisma ORM)
- AI-powered Product Analysis (Gemini API)
- Trade Analysis History
- Protected API Routes
- Input Validation (Zod)
- REST API Architecture
- Optional Google Search Grounding (Live Verification)

---

# Tech Stack

- Node.js
- Express.js
- TypeScript
- PostgreSQL
- Prisma ORM
- JWT Authentication
- bcrypt
- Zod
- Google Gemini API

---

